  "body": "This is a simplification attempt removing the special Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy value \"same-origin-plus-coep\" and instead checking separately the values of both Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy and Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy.\n\nI am not sure why \"same-origin-plus-coep\" was introduced, but I believe removing it makes the spec cleaner. Moreover, it avoids the potential bugs caused by storing the same information at two different places\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6866/browsers.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 16, 2021, 1:04 PM UTC (d05e3e8)\">/browsers.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6866/74a7491...d05e3e8/browsers.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 16, 2021, 1:04 PM UTC (d05e3e8)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6866/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 16, 2021, 1:04 PM UTC (d05e3e8)\">/browsing-the-web.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6866/74a7491...d05e3e8/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 16, 2021, 1:04 PM UTC (d05e3e8)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6866/origin.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 16, 2021, 1:04 PM UTC (d05e3e8)\">/origin.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6866/74a7491...d05e3e8/origin.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 16, 2021, 1:04 PM UTC (d05e3e8)\">diff</a> )",
